{"url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/5200620/","dev":"louidev","pub":"louidev","short":"Dungeonbound 是一款復古風第一人稱自動戰鬥地下城探索遊戲。派出你的戰士、法師或盜賊，深入怪物成群的地底，看戰鬥一回合一回合展開，每次冒險都變得更強。死亡只是帶著戰利品回家。合成裝備，購買升級，再次下潛。","plat":["win","mac"],"ws":false,"img":{"hero":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5200620/5353b9410c5060e7b60bb72ef288ccaf06617b65/library_hero.jpg?t=1794984507","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5200620/b3a32d9086038acf42c9457c2bc062f93d90ea3e/header.jpg?t=1794984507","wide":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5200620/d7d1039f2a964343fdbba4ae8a0a3278134d7289/capsule_616x353.jpg?t=1794984507","box":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5200620/20078e35401b6efe4d5ab8ad8337900eef3f2441/library_capsule.jpg?t=1794984507"},"shots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5200620/b3f73bb8dc9cd8359443fa0b097eb2a428310fb2/ss_b3f73bb8dc9cd8359443fa0b097eb2a428310fb2.jpg?t=1794984507","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5200620/58c2f3ecc5440202c4cbf5890ee14df3f525306f/ss_58c2f3ecc5440202c4cbf5890ee14df3f525306f.jpg?t=1794984507","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5200620/729d78262dcbdf52d7194f282d0e857bd3551b3e/ss_729d78262dcbdf52d7194f282d0e857bd3551b3e.jpg?t=1794984507","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5200620/656df4f048585c05fc00d707296909104b66f7a3/ss_656df4f048585c05fc00d707296909104b66f7a3.jpg?t=1794984507","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5200620/aec9225bdb327f72bd7bb5173ca389be544e7724/ss_aec9225bdb327f72bd7bb5173ca389be544e7724.jpg?t=1794984507","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5200620/e00ffe61e9a5194b88e0dbac3a6a5271ac4fdea8/ss_e00ffe61e9a5194b88e0dbac3a6a5271ac4fdea8.jpg?t=1794984507","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass